      "source": "https://resources.arc.net/hc/en-us/articles/20498377604887-Arc-for-macOS-2023-Release-Notes",
      "title": "Arc for macOS - 2023 Release Notes",
      "section": "## December 7, 2023 —",
      "source_text_line": 24,
      "text": "* You can now opt in to show the Full URL in Toolbar. Start by turning on Toolbar in View > Show Toolbar. Then right-click on Toolbar to \"Show Full URL\".",
      "saved_file": "official-docs/20498377604887.md"
    },
    {
      "source": "https://resources.arc.net/hc/en-us/articles/20498377604887-Arc-for-macOS-2023-Release-Notes",
      "title": "Arc for macOS - 2023 Release Notes",
      "section": "## September 28, 2023 —",
      "source_text_line": 171,
      "text": "* The Arc Toolbar (View > Show Toolbar) will now show translation prompts on sites not in your primary language.",
      "saved_file": "official-docs/20498377604887.md"
    },
    {
      "source": "https://resources.arc.net/hc/en-us/articles/20498377604887-Arc-for-macOS-2023-Release-Notes",
      "title": "Arc for macOS - 2023 Release Notes",
      "section": "## August 17, 2023 —",
      "source_text_line": 270,
      "text": "* We've improved our Toolbar color logic (View > Show Toolbar).",
      "saved_file": "official-docs/20498377604887.md"
    },
    {
      "source": "https://resources.arc.net/hc/en-us/articles/20498377604887-Arc-for-macOS-2023-Release-Notes",
      "title": "Arc for macOS - 2023 Release Notes",
      "section": "## July 21, 2023 —",
      "source_text_line": 318,
      "text": "* You can opt into viewing a full URL Bar and pinned Extensions at all times by enabling the Toolbar! Head to View > Show Toolbar to turn on.",
      "saved_file": "official-docs/20498377604887.md"
    },
    {
      "source": "https://resources.arc.net/hc/en-us/articles/20498293324823-Arc-for-macOS-2024-2026-Release-Notes",
      "title": "Arc for macOS - 2024 - 2026 Release Notes",
      "section": "## Apr 18, 2024 —",
      "source_text_line": 900,
      "text": "* The Toolbar now renders in Peeked tabs! To toggle on the setting, hit Command T and type \"Show Toolbar.\"",
      "saved_file": "official-docs/20498293324823.md"
    },
    {
      "source": "https://resources.arc.net/hc/en-us/articles/20498293324823-Arc-for-macOS-2024-2026-Release-Notes",
      "title": "Arc for macOS - 2024 - 2026 Release Notes",
      "section": "## Mar 28, 2024 —",
      "source_text_line": 918,
      "text": "* For Arc Toolbar users, we've added a subtle divider separating the toolbar from your web content. You can turn on the Arc Toolbar by going to View > Show Toolbar. You can turn it off by going to View > Hide Toolbar.",
      "saved_file": "official-docs/20498293324823.md"
    },
    {
      "source": "https://resources.arc.net/hc/en-us/articles/20498293324823-Arc-for-macOS-2024-2026-Release-Notes",
      "title": "Arc for macOS - 2024 - 2026 Release Notes",
      "section": "## January 25, 2024 —",
      "source_text_line": 1028,
      "text": "* The Sidebar now responds to clicks even when the Command Bar (Cmd + T) is open. You can interact with it without having to dismiss the Command Bar first.",
